WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:04.788
Loro followed Zella and Raff as they moved away from the cave.

2
00:00:04.789 --> 00:00:07.709
He didn't know the other two kids very well yet.

3
00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:14.041
He wasn't sure whether they would give up on exploring the cave or try again after the mayor was gone.

4
00:00:14.042 --> 00:00:19.007
"Yikes! I can't believe the mayor was so angry at us," Zella said.

5
00:00:19.008 --> 00:00:22.416
"I've never seen her yell at anyone like that."

6
00:00:22.417 --> 00:00:28.749
"Yeah." Raff sounded upset. "Usually she's so calm and friendly."

7
00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:33.967
"She must be really worried about the Sovereign's Staff's disappearance," Zella said.

8
00:00:33.968 --> 00:00:37.213
"Plus, this cave is so close to Stone Wall.

9
00:00:37.214 --> 00:00:42.451
If King Zanta left a lot of old relics lying around inside, it could be dangerous here.

10
00:00:42.452 --> 00:00:45.038
And it's her job to protect everyone."

11
00:00:45.039 --> 00:00:48.171
"I still don't get it," Raff said.

12
00:00:48.172 --> 00:00:52.541
"How did she know we were in the cave?" He looked at Loro.

13
00:00:52.542 --> 00:00:55.733
"Are you sure she didn't see you?"

14
00:00:55.734 --> 00:00:58.847
"I'm pretty sure." Loro shrugged.

15
00:00:58.848 --> 00:01:03.207
"She just stomped right over to the cave and went inside."

16
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:08.134
"Well, I don't know how she found us, and I don't care," Zella said.

17
00:01:08.135 --> 00:01:11.082
"Let's hide in the bushes until she comes out.

18
00:01:11.083 --> 00:01:14.170
After she leaves, we can sneak back in.

19
00:01:14.171 --> 00:01:16.897
She probably won't expect us to do that."

20
00:01:16.898 --> 00:01:21.652
"Are you serious, Zella?" Raff looked dismayed.

21
00:01:21.653 --> 00:01:26.483
"We could get in serious trouble! If Mom and Dad find out . . ."

22
00:01:26.484 --> 00:01:31.308
Loro cleared his throat. "He's right, Zella.

23
00:01:31.309 --> 00:01:34.155
It's too risky to go back in right now.

24
00:01:34.156 --> 00:01:37.902
Besides, don't you want to wait for a reply from Zann?

25
00:01:37.903 --> 00:01:41.874
Maybe he has some good ideas about how to find the staff."

26
00:01:41.875 --> 00:01:47.527
Zella brightened slightly. "That's true." Then she frowned.

27
00:01:47.528 --> 00:01:50.069
"But I still don't want to wait.

28
00:01:50.070 --> 00:01:53.647
If someone stole that staff, we need to know right away!

29
00:01:53.648 --> 00:01:56.494
Especially if it's a dangerous relic!"

30
00:01:56.495 --> 00:02:02.415
Loro felt worried. Zella seemed determined to go back into the cave right away.

31
00:02:02.416 --> 00:02:06.541
"It's too dangerous for them to wander around in there," he thought.

32
00:02:06.542 --> 00:02:10.110
Meanwhile Raff was looking around the clearing.

33
00:02:10.111 --> 00:02:15.152
"Hey, where's Muncher? I thought he'd be out here eating weeds."

34
00:02:15.153 --> 00:02:18.218
"He was here when I came out," Loro said.

35
00:02:18.219 --> 00:02:20.383
"I might have startled him.

36
00:02:20.384 --> 00:02:24.541
As soon as he saw me, he made a noise and ran into the woods."

37
00:02:24.542 --> 00:02:30.621
"That's weird," Raff said. "He isn't usually skittish."

38
00:02:30.622 --> 00:02:34.752
"He probably went home." Zella sounded distracted.

39
00:02:34.753 --> 00:02:38.209
Loro glanced toward the cave entrance.

40
00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:41.785
"We shouldn't be talking here where the mayor might hear us.

41
00:02:41.786 --> 00:02:45.173
Let's go hide in the woods behind the wormhole."

42
00:02:45.174 --> 00:02:47.892
"Sounds good to me," Zella said.

43
00:02:47.893 --> 00:02:51.236
"I want to take another look at that wormhole anyway."

44
00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:54.827
She hurried across the clearing. Loro and Raff followed her.

45
00:02:54.828 --> 00:02:59.758
"Is your sister always like this?" Loro asked in a low voice.

46
00:02:59.759 --> 00:03:03.356
"She's, um, pretty adventurous."

47
00:03:03.357 --> 00:03:10.916
Raff sighed. "Yes. Except there usually aren't many adventures in Stone Wall."

48
00:03:10.917 --> 00:03:16.499
Up ahead, Zella stepped closer to the wormhole. It swirled open.

49
00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:19.541
"Be careful, Zella," Raff called.

50
00:03:19.542 --> 00:03:23.764
"I'm fine," she said, staring into the spinning depths.

51
00:03:23.765 --> 00:03:27.957
"It's so strange how this wormhole just appeared here."

52
00:03:27.958 --> 00:03:31.746
"Wormholes can pop up anywhere," Raff said.

53
00:03:31.747 --> 00:03:35.871
"At least that's what our teacher told us when we studied them in school."

54
00:03:35.872 --> 00:03:38.124
"I know," Zella said.

55
00:03:38.125 --> 00:03:44.510
"I just think it's an odd coincidence that this one appeared right by a hidden cave that had a powerful relic inside.

56
00:03:44.510 --> 00:03:47.931
Maybe the two things are connected somehow."

57
00:03:47.932 --> 00:03:51.624
"Maybe there is a connection," Loro said.

58
00:03:51.625 --> 00:03:55.212
"But don't forget—we're not sure that thing is a relic.

59
00:03:55.213 --> 00:04:00.287
It could be just an ordinary old staff that someone left there."

60
00:04:00.288 --> 00:04:03.500
Zella was still staring into the wormhole.

61
00:04:03.501 --> 00:04:06.676
"I wonder what it would be like to jump in there.

62
00:04:06.677 --> 00:04:11.022
Zann and his friends used the vortex to visit all kinds of other worlds."

63
00:04:11.023 --> 00:04:15.832
"Right, like Fardark." Raff shook his head.

64
00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:19.950
"No thanks, I definitely don't want to go there."

65
00:04:19.951 --> 00:04:25.291
"Not just Fardark," Zella said. "They visited nice worlds too.

66
00:04:25.292 --> 00:04:28.723
There was Mistafar, where their friend Ello lives.

67
00:04:28.724 --> 00:04:32.296
And Niffia, where the people are intelligent and friendly."

68
00:04:32.297 --> 00:04:36.250
"And where the people have no noses," Raff said.

69
00:04:36.251 --> 00:04:40.746
"You told me that Niffia stinks worse than Muncher when he passes gas!"

70
00:04:40.747 --> 00:04:48.355
Zella laughed. "Okay, but I'd still like to visit, at least for a short time.

71
00:04:48.356 --> 00:04:52.504
I'd also love to see Pax and Zon. Oh! And also Rood.

72
00:04:52.505 --> 00:04:56.202
You can visit every wormhole in the vortex from there!"

73
00:04:56.203 --> 00:05:01.829
She went on to describe several other interesting worlds she'd heard about from the kid heroes.

74
00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.937
Loro was surprised by some of her stories.

75
00:05:04.938 --> 00:05:08.752
He'd known that Zann and the others had traveled a lot.

76
00:05:08.753 --> 00:05:13.150
But it sounded as if they'd visited even more worlds than he'd realized.

77
00:05:13.151 --> 00:05:16.543
He would have to tell his parents when he saw them.

78
00:05:16.544 --> 00:05:20.757
"I wish I could visit Gabble," Zella went on wistfully.

79
00:05:20.758 --> 00:05:23.307
"Everything there has a voice.

80
00:05:23.308 --> 00:05:27.772
You can say hello to a rock and have a conversation with a tree!"

81
00:05:27.773 --> 00:05:30.050
Raff rolled his eyes.

82
00:05:30.051 --> 00:05:37.082
"You should probably visit First City before you go twirling off through the vortex like some country bumpkin."

83
00:05:37.083 --> 00:05:42.397
"Very funny." Zella turned away from the wormhole to scowl at her brother.

84
00:05:42.398 --> 00:05:47.639
"For now, I'm stuck living in Stone Wall—with you!

85
00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:53.499
But someday I'll visit interesting places and have exciting adventures, just like Zann."

86
00:05:53.500 --> 00:05:56.936
"Let's go back to the village," Loro said.

87
00:05:56.937 --> 00:06:00.204
"We can have a snack and talk about what to do next."

88
00:06:00.205 --> 00:06:04.713
Before the others could respond, a spy fly buzzed into view.

89
00:06:04.714 --> 00:06:08.439
It circled the three kids, and then zipped toward Zella.

90
00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:12.447
She let out a cry of surprise as it burrowed into her ear.

91
00:06:12.448 --> 00:06:18.167
"Oh wow!" she said. Loro saw her face light up with excitement.

92
00:06:18.168 --> 00:06:21.714
"It's a video message from Zann and Perda!"
